  "prefLabel": "Ban 104.02 Access to Department Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ban 104.02 Access to Department Information.\n\n(a) The commissioner's annual report and other department information shall be available at www.banking.nh.gov/forms-publications/annual-reports-commissioner.\n\n(b) The department's administrative rules shall be available for examination at:\n\n(1) The department's office; and\n\n(2) The department’s website at www.banking.nh.gov/banks-credit-unions/laws-rules-guidance.\n\n(c) Information available on the department’s website includes:\n\n(1) Public orders from 2009 onwards; and\n\n(2) Current lists of New Hampshire chartered institutions and licensees.\n\nSource. #10258, eff 1-24-13; ss by #10442, eff 10-19-13; ss by #14096, eff 10-3-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ban100.html"
